      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "prompt_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{l} \\text {设} A_{1}, A_{2}, A_{3} \\text {是随机试验} E \\text {的三个相互独立的事件，且知} P(A_{1}) = \\alpha,\\ P(A_{2}) = \\beta,\\ P(A_{3}) = \\gamma, \\text {则事件“在} A_{1} \\text {已发生的条件下，} A_{2}, A_{3} \\text {都不发生”的概率是( ).} \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{l} \\text {设} A_{1}, A_{2}, A_{3} \\text {是随机试验} E \\text {的三个相互独立的事件，且知} P(A_{1}) = \\alpha,\\ P(A_{2}) = \\beta,\\ P(A_{3}) = \\gamma, \\text {则事件“在} A_{1} \\text {已发生的条件下，} A_{2}, A_{3} \\text {都不发生”的概率是( ).} \\end{array}</div>",
